      "id": "c3-body",
      "x": 1674,
      "y": 544,
      "width": 637,
      "height": 203,
      "text": "transport/ipass_proxy.rs：统一封装\n原请求先经过 endpoint.req_envelope\n保留 {payload: \"<JSON字符串>\"} 等网关信封\n参数：provider / method / path / query /\nheaders / bodyBase64\n去除 Authorization / Cookie，再 POST 到 OC",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
