      "type": "text",
      "id": "c4-body",
      "x": 2389,
      "y": 544,
      "width": 637,
      "height": 203,
      "text": "代理分支跳过本地 token 加载、注入和刷新\ncmd/auth.rs：OC 模式拒绝 auth init / show\nIPASS_SESSION_ID → x-ipass-session-id（必需）\nIPASS_ACTIVE_CALL_ID → x-ipass-call-id\nIPASS_ACTIVE_MESSAGE_ID → x-ipass-message-id\n后两项可选；完整透传才能关联授权卡",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "代理分支跳过本地 token 加载、注入和刷新\ncmd/auth.rs：OC 模式拒绝 auth init / show\nIPASS_SESSION_ID → x-ipass-session-id（必需）\nIPASS_ACTIVE_CALL_ID → x-ipass-call-id\nIPASS_ACTIVE_MESSAGE_ID → x-ipass-message-id\n后两项可选；完整透传才能关联授权卡",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
