      "text": "3  HTTP adapter：统一入口与协议",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3  HTTP adapter：统一入口与协议",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0.6,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 10068,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 100068,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [
        "p3"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791763200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p3-body",
      "x": 3274,
      "y": 544,
      "width": 637,
      "height": 203,
      "text": "aipower/src/routes/oc.ts\nPOST /oc_adapter/ipass-proxy/:kind\n读取 x-ipass-* header，恢复 ToolContext\n接收 provider / method / path / query /\nheaders / bodyBase64，再交给匹配的 executor\n缺 session：400；未注册：503；执行异常：502",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "aipower/src/routes/oc.ts\nPOST /oc_adapter/ipass-proxy/:kind\n读取 x-ipass-* header，恢复 ToolContext\n接收 provider / method / path / query /\nheaders / bodyBase64，再交给匹配的 executor\n缺 session：400；未注册：503；执行异常：502",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
