      "type": "text",
      "id": "p4-body",
      "x": 3989,
      "y": 544,
      "width": 637,
      "height": 203,
      "text": "tools/adapter.ts：allow / ask / deny\nask → permission 卡，本次放行才继续\nfactories/ipaas.ts：iPaaS auth-check\n缺凭证 → ipaas_auth 卡 → 等待用户授权\n授权后重新检查，继续原请求\ncallID / messageID 把卡关联到原 bash 消息",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "tools/adapter.ts：allow / ask / deny\nask → permission 卡，本次放行才继续\nfactories/ipaas.ts：iPaaS auth-check\n缺凭证 → ipaas_auth 卡 → 等待用户授权\n授权后重新检查，继续原请求\ncallID / messageID 把卡关联到原 bash 消息",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
