      "width": 637,
      "height": 293,
      "text": "POST /oc_adapter/ipass-proxy/wecom\n{\n  provider: \"wecom\", method: \"POST\",\n  path: \"/todo/list\", query: \"\",\n  headers: {\"content-type\": \"application/json\"},\n  bodyBase64: \"<原网关请求体的 Base64>\"\n}\n外层 HTTP header 携带三个 x-ipass-* 上下文 ID",
