      "text": "POST /v2/oc/sessions/{sid}/tools/call-async\n绑定定位摘要：\n  targetType = IPAAS_CONNECTOR\n  targetId = connectorCode\n  toolName = actionCode\n  uuid / versionNumber / runId\n  appInstUuid（IPAAS_APP 可选）\n  params = 左侧的 raw 请求参数",
